## an3.68
an3.68:1.1 | S: “Mendicants, if wanderers of other religions were to ask: | T: “Monks, if you are asked by wanderers of other sects,
an3.68:1.2 | S: ‘There are these three things. | T: ‘Friends, there are these three qualities.
